WEBVTT

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.526
<v><b>David:</b></v> Olivia’s car was in the station car park.

00:00:11.651 --> 00:00:12.375
‘Nice car.’

00:00:15.492 --> 00:00:17.447
It was a big BMW.

00:00:21.048 --> 00:00:23.019
She was a very fast driver.

00:00:26.324 --> 00:00:28.477
She stopped outside my flat.

00:00:38.149 --> 00:00:41.003
We said goodbye and exchanged phone numbers.

00:00:58.203 --> 00:01:01.041
The next morning there was a message from Olivia.

00:01:04.626 --> 00:01:06.792
<v><b>Olivia:</b></v> I really want to see you again!

00:01:07.637 --> 00:01:08.358
Friday?

00:01:24.664 --> 00:01:27.317
<v><b>David:</b></v> On Friday morning, Olivia phoned me.

00:01:29.507 --> 00:01:30.106
Hello.

00:01:30.709 --> 00:01:35.574
<v><b>Olivia:</b></v> I have two tickets for a Beethoven concert tonight at the Royal Albert Hall!

00:01:36.378 --> 00:01:39.309
Can you get them from the box office at seven fifteen?

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:42.892
We can meet in the bar at seven thirty.

00:01:43.743 --> 00:01:45.327
The concert starts at eight.